            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Spencer"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We have a ton of mint in the garden; it is a weed. This recipe makes an easy, relatively short prep time for a great accompaniment for lamb. Tangy sweet. Easy to adjust to taste.",
            "datePublished": "2018-09-10T11:13:33.377Z"
