              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pizzalisa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this chutney on Easter Sunday to go along with a great lamb dish on allrecipes (Holiday Leg of Lamb). I thought this dish was awesome. It went really well with the lamb and even the prime rib we grilled. Very refreshing. I purchased two little packets of mint from the store. This gave me enough mint for half the recipe which was plenty for the meal. I will definitely make this again!",
